ind":"update","title":"PvE & Bot Matches - Major Demo Update!","summary":"Hi everyone! Oink Splash Party just got a major update: our first version of PvE is here!You can now play solo against bots or team up with friends and fill the waterpark with up to 12 players in total. Whether you want a smaller 1v1 match or a full 6v6 battle, you can mix and match players and bots to create the match you want! What's new?-Play solo: Jump into matches without needing other players.-Play with friends: Team up and take on bot-filled matches together.-Up to 12 players: Play anythi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T01:04:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040983","verified_at":"2026-10-25T04:06:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4660200-1847286114036951","game_id":"steam-4660200","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch the Devs Play During Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Join us during Steam Next Fest as we play Oink Splash Party live! Expect chaotic multiplayer matches, questionable strategies, spectacular fails, and plenty of Oinks getting launched into the water. Come hang out with the Team Chili devs, see the game in action, and discover what we've been working on! We don't stream every day, but you can usually catch us live between 6 PM and 8 PM Spanish time. See you in the water!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:49:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036951","verified_at":"2026-10-23T18:59:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4660200-1846651706690870","game_id":"steam-4660200","kind":"announcement","title":"Oink — Steam Next Fest LIVE!","summary":"We're celebrating Steam Next Fest with Oink Splash Party! See the game in action, and join the fun! Haven't tried it yet? The demo is free to play on Steam. Grab your friends and jump into the waterpark! Stay Oinky!!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:48:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690870","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4660200-1846651706678815","game_id":"steam-4660200","kind":"announcement","title":"Oink Splash Party is coming to Steam Next Fest October 19–26!","summary":"Steam Next Fest kicks off on October 19, and Oink Splash Party is joining the festival! Our demo is already free to play on Steam, so there's no need to wait. Jump into the waterparks, get familiar with our oinky physics, and see what happens when a bunch of Oinks fight over an Octoball! We're still hard at work building towards Early Access, with more game modes, improvements, and plenty of new things planned for the full release. This demo is just a taste of what's to come, and we're excited t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T17:56:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678815","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4660200-1846018067936016","game_id":"steam-4660200","kind":"announcement","title":"Oink Splash Party Demo Is Out Now! We're Joining Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone!We've been hard at work on Oink Splash Party, and we're really happy to finally put our demo in your hands! With Steam Next Fest kicking off on October 19, we decided to release the demo a little early so everyone can jump into the waterparks and get a taste of the game before the festival begins!What's in the demo?We've prepared a tutorial to get you started, along with our first map and game mode: Score Battle! Get a feel for our movement and physics, experiment with the way Oinks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T11:13:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936016","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4660200-1845383656377101","game_id":"steam-4660200","kind":"announcement","title":"Dive into Oink Splash Party's Original Soundtrack!","summary":"Dive into Oink Splash Party's Original Soundtrack! A handcrafted soundtrack, lovingly composed by Churi González. As the Game Demo and Steam Fest approach, we wanted to take you on a little dive into the funky music of the Oinks! Listen for free on YouTube! @TeamChiliGames More news regarding the Demo and Steam Fest coming very soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T10:45:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377101","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4660200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4660200":"2026-10-26T03:18:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4660200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5218390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4660200","app_id":4660200,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:46Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana",